    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mmultiscripts><mo>&#8800;</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><none></none></mmultiscripts><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math>,&nbsp;Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math>&nbsp;be the sum of all diagonal elements of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
